  "title": "Talent Acquisition Solution Providers’ Embrace of AI Realizes Significant Efficiency Gains for Recruiters",
  "summary": "The Hackett Group® Solution Intelligence's new 2026 Talent Acquisition Vendor Assessments found that organizations using advanced recruiting technologies report an average 32% improvement in time-to-fill and time-to-hire, a 72% improvement in hiring automation, and a 70% increase in recruiter efficiency. As HR teams face rising workloads and resource constraints, talent acquisition technology providers are accelerating innovation through AI, automation and agentic capabilities that help recruiters work more effectively while enhancing the candidate experience.",
